From c88eabd284bf90cadeb598766f72811f0ec46649 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayesh Rathod <jayesh4.rathod@ril.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:36:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 08/14] Add gateway, stage and pending-setup notices to all
 three scanners
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Step 10 of the Cross-Scanner Eligibility and Corporate Lifecycle Sprint.

Two of the earlier steps changed behaviour in ways that are invisible without
reporting, which would be worse than the original defect:

* A merged symbol now disappears from the output. Without a notice that reads as
  a silent omission rather than a decision.
* READY no longer opens a position. Without a pending-setup section a symbol
  appears to qualify and then nothing happens.

Added v2/scanner_notices.py, rendering once for all three scanners:

  render_data_note        the market date, flagging a run date that trails it
  render_gateway_notice   admission counts, and terminal symbols named with
                          their successor, last trading date and ratio, plus
                          "Price history retained"
  render_stage_summary    RADAR/CONFIRMING/READY counts, availability states,
                          and what is holding symbols below READY
  render_pending_setups   "READY — NOT ENTERED" with the entry range, the stop,
                          how long it has waited and "Await next-session trigger"
  render_expired_setups   why a setup lapsed, so a non-entry is explained
  render_reconciliation   conversions as zero-P&L events with the fractional
                          entitlement spelled out, and universe exits with price

UniverseVerdict.diagnostics() now carries terminal_detail, so a renderer holding
only the diagnostics dict can still name a merger's successor rather than
reporting a bare disappearance. Hull Pine hit exactly this: its card said only
"JBCHEPHARM — TERMINAL" before.

Rendered against the real store at 2026-08-20, the Hull Pine card now ends:

  🛡️ TRADEABILITY
  Admitted 1791 of 2015
  Observe-only (unverified instrument): 229
  • NON_EQ_SERIES: 103  • RESTRICTED_SECURITY: 101
  • STALE_SYMBOL_PRICE: 19  • TERMINAL_MERGER: 1
  ⛔ JBCHEPHARM — TERMINAL_MERGER, last traded 2026-07-16 → TORNTPHARM (0.51 per share)
     Excluded from current scanning. Price history retained.
  ⚠️ KIRLPNU — corporate event pending; entry withheld

Notices are appended, so no existing message assertion changes.

Tests: 18 new. Suite unchanged apart from the same 7 pre-existing failures.
